    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an angler haunted by huge debts. In the midst of yet another night working at sea, you catch something different: a fish which talks, and promises to make you rich... but at what cost?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brief (around 30 minutes) fishing horror game about debt and hopelessness.</strong> Enjoy a twisted cautionary tale in one sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/d8f1b63dfb3d4eb05649d4eb3deab34f.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/d8f1b63dfb3d4eb05649d4eb3deab34f.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/d8f1b63dfb3d4eb05649d4eb3deab34f.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater eye-cam.\u00a0</strong>Watch the fish biting the lure, then retrieve it as fast as you can. Be careful though: something else may be watching you as well...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4f3bb6f9089705c8ff2dea30826a2f98.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4f3bb6f9089705c8ff2dea30826a2f98.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4f3bb6f9089705c8ff2dea30826a2f98.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish and gut</strong>. Fly-fish like a pro, then gut your catch to keep 'em fresh. Be careful with the knife though: you don't want to cut yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4c090b68f897f69f14abb091050166fa.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4c090b68f897f69f14abb091050166fa.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4c090b68f897f69f14abb091050166fa.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The talking fish wants a deal</strong>. Consider the alluring promises of this mysterious being through surreal dialogues and twisted choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/e7b52e3ef9d7c08d0fb44193e134685f.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/e7b52e3ef9d7c08d0fb44193e134685f.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/e7b52e3ef9d7c08d0fb44193e134685f.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The loan shark is coming</strong>. This is no relaxing cozy fishing experience. Your time is running out, and something horrible lurks in the water.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/a24ff607f90f0eb48d8b28ea9352d977.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/a24ff607f90f0eb48d8b28ea9352d977.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/a24ff607f90f0eb48d8b28ea9352d977.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are an angler haunted by huge debts. In the midst of yet another night working at sea, you catch something different: a fish which talks, and promises to make you rich... but at what cost?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A brief (around 30 minutes) fishing horror game about debt and hopelessness.</strong> Enjoy a twisted cautionary tale in one sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/d8f1b63dfb3d4eb05649d4eb3deab34f.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/d8f1b63dfb3d4eb05649d4eb3deab34f.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/d8f1b63dfb3d4eb05649d4eb3deab34f.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Underwater eye-cam.\u00a0</strong>Watch the fish biting the lure, then retrieve it as fast as you can. Be careful though: something else may be watching you as well...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4f3bb6f9089705c8ff2dea30826a2f98.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4f3bb6f9089705c8ff2dea30826a2f98.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4f3bb6f9089705c8ff2dea30826a2f98.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish and gut</strong>. Fly-fish like a pro, then gut your catch to keep 'em fresh. Be careful with the knife though: you don't want to cut yourself.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4c090b68f897f69f14abb091050166fa.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4c090b68f897f69f14abb091050166fa.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/4c090b68f897f69f14abb091050166fa.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The talking fish wants a deal</strong>. Consider the alluring promises of this mysterious being through surreal dialogues and twisted choices.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/e7b52e3ef9d7c08d0fb44193e134685f.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/e7b52e3ef9d7c08d0fb44193e134685f.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/e7b52e3ef9d7c08d0fb44193e134685f.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The loan shark is coming</strong>. This is no relaxing cozy fishing experience. Your time is running out, and something horrible lurks in the water.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/a24ff607f90f0eb48d8b28ea9352d977.poster.avif?t=1754636887\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/a24ff607f90f0eb48d8b28ea9352d977.webm?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3751730/extras/a24ff607f90f0eb48d8b28ea9352d977.mp4?t=1754636887\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
